# Salesforce GenAI Development Best Practices

This rule provides comprehensive guidelines for developing Salesforce applications with GenAI capabilities, focusing on Prompt Templates and Agentforce Agents.

## Prompt Template Development

### 1. Prompt Template Structure

**Metadata File Structure:**
```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<PromptTemplate xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <label>Descriptive Template Name</label>
    <description>Clear description of template purpose</description>
    <promptText>
        You are a {role} helping with {task}.
        
        Context:
        - Customer: {!Contact.Name}
        - Account: {!Contact.Account.Name}
        - Additional Data: {!CustomField__c}
        
        Instructions:
        1. Be {tone} and {style}
        2. Address the customer by name
        3. Provide specific, actionable solutions
        4. Reference relevant data when appropriate
        
        User Query: {!UserInput}
        
        Generate a personalized response.
    </promptText>
    <modelParameters>
        <temperature>0.7</temperature>
        <maxTokens>500</maxTokens>
    </modelParameters>
    <isActive>true</isActive>
</PromptTemplate>
```

### 2. Apex Integration for Prompt Templates

**Prompt Template Action Class:**
```apex
public class PromptTemplateAction {
    @InvocableMethod(
        label='Generate AI Response'
        description='Uses prompt template to generate contextual responses'
        category='AI Actions'
    )
    public static List<PromptResponse> generateResponse(List<PromptRequest> requests) {
        List<PromptResponse> responses = new List<PromptResponse>();
        
        for (PromptRequest request : requests) {
            try {
                // Validate inputs
                validateRequest(request);
                
                // Gather contextual data
                Map<String, Object> contextData = gatherContextData(request);
                
                // Call prompt template
                String response = executePromptTemplate(request.templateName, contextData);
                
                // Post-process response
                String finalResponse = postProcessResponse(response, request.preferences);
                
                responses.add(new PromptResponse(finalResponse, 'success', null));
                
            } catch (Exception e) {
                logError('PromptTemplateAction', e, request);
                responses.add(new PromptResponse(
                    'I apologize, but I encountered an error processing your request.',
                    'error',
                    e.getMessage()
                ));
            }
        }
        
        return responses;
    }
    
    private static void validateRequest(PromptRequest request) {
        if (String.isBlank(request.templateName)) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException('Template name is required');
        }
        if (String.isBlank(request.userInput)) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException('User input is required');
        }
    }
    
    private static Map<String, Object> gatherContextData(PromptRequest request) {
        Map<String, Object> contextData = new Map<String, Object>();
        
        // Add user context
        contextData.put('User', getCurrentUserContext());
        
        // Add record context if provided
        if (request.recordId != null) {
            contextData.put('Record', getRecordContext(request.recordId));
        }
        
        // Add business context
        contextData.put('BusinessRules', getBusinessRules(request.context));
        
        return contextData;
    }
    
    public class PromptRequest {
        @InvocableVariable(label='Template Name' description='Name of the prompt template to use')
        public String templateName;
        
        @InvocableVariable(label='User Input' description='User query or input')
        public String userInput;
        
        @InvocableVariable(label='Record ID' description='Related Salesforce record ID')
        public Id recordId;
        
        @InvocableVariable(label='Context' description='Additional context for the prompt')
        public String context;
        
        @InvocableVariable(label='Preferences' description='User preferences for response style')
        public String preferences;
    }
    
    public class PromptResponse {
        @InvocableVariable(label='Response' description='Generated AI response')
        public String response;
        
        @InvocableVariable(label='Status' description='Success or error status')
        public String status;
        
        @InvocableVariable(label='Error Message' description='Error details if any')
        public String errorMessage;
        
        public PromptResponse(String response, String status, String errorMessage) {
            this.response = response;
            this.status = status;
            this.errorMessage = errorMessage;
        }
    }
}
```

## Agentforce Agent Development

### 3. Agent Action Development

**Core Agent Action Pattern:**
